text = "PLAYTIME:Improvements & Fixes:

Bug Fixes

Fixed a crash that occurred when exploring the old church in Act 4.

Resolved an issue where diary pages sometimes did not appear in the inventory.

Corrected NPC dialogue timing to prevent overlapping speech in flashback sequences.

Gameplay Improvements

Adjusted lighting and shadows in the forest scene to enhance psychological horror effect.

Improved responsiveness of Danilo’s movement in narrow corridors.

Optimized save/load system to prevent corrupted save files.

UI/UX Enhancements

Patch notes now accessible directly from the in-game menu.

Updated character portraits in flashback sequences for consistency.

Improved visual feedback when picking up diary pages and items.

Minor Changes

Background music adjusted for better immersion in suspenseful areas.

Fixed typos in journal entries and NPC dialogues.

Reduced unnecessary load times when switching scenes.

Developer Notes:
This patch ensures smoother gameplay and fixes critical bugs that were affecting the storytelling experience. Players are encouraged to explore all previously inaccessible areas to uncover hidden clues."
autowrap_mode = 3

